THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS AND TRAINING DATA

This licence covers the SongForge source code. It does not relicense the
components below, each of which keeps its own terms.

Foundation model
  ACE-Step 1.5 (XL-turbo variant) — MIT. Used as a frozen pretrained
  foundation and loaded from local checkpoints. The Gradio/Side-Step
  standalone distribution (CC BY-NC-SA) is deliberately NOT used; only the
  MIT-licensed `acestep/training_v2` path inside the official repository is.

Training corpora — every deployable record is CC0 or CC BY, verified against
each source's own metadata rather than assumed:
  Slakh2100-redux .................. CC BY 4.0
  Free Music Archive (subset) ...... CC0 1.0 / CC BY, per track
  VocalSet ......................... CC BY 4.0  (Zenodo 1193957)
  MusicNet ......................... CC BY 4.0  (Zenodo 5120004)
  GuitarSet ........................ CC BY 4.0  (Zenodo 3371780)

Excluded outright from the deployable model: CC BY-NC, CC BY-ND, CC BY-SA,
and any record whose licence could not be resolved. For the Free Music
Archive this excluded 93,713 NonCommercial, 2,802 ShareAlike, 903
NoDerivatives and 317 unknown tracks out of 106,574 censused.

CC BY attribution for the corpora above is carried in docs/ATTRIBUTION.md.
